url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"Usage error. Bad arguments, a malformed config, or similar."},"1270":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"`2`"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"Deprecated-invocation or warning-gate exit. The legacy `forge` console command exits `2` without running anything, printing a message to invoke `decoy` instead; `decoy validate config --fail-on-warning` and `decoy preflight --fail-on-warning` also exit `2` when an advisory warning fires (for example an output target that already exists)."},"1272":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"`3`"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-14","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"Runtime error. The command started but failed while running."},"1274":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"`4`"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"Findings. The command completed but surfaced something that needs review, for example `storm analyze` finding PII, or a distribution-fidelity check landing below policy (`decoy validate distribution --fail`/`--mode fail` also uses `4` for its own warning/fail verdicts)."},"1276":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"Renamed subcommands, such as the old `decoy storm scan` name for `decoy\nstorm analyze`, are a different thing: they still run, print a migration\nwarning to stderr, and exit `0` on success like the command they alias. Exit\ncode `2` is not reserved for renamed subcommands; it covers the legacy\n`forge` shim plus the `--fail-on-warning` gate on `validate config` and\n`preflight`."},"1277":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#exit-codes","content":"See Use decoy in CI for how to branch on these\ncodes in a pipeline, including why exit code `4` is not the same as a failure."},"1278":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#command-map","content":"Decoy -- data masking and synthetic generation CLI."},"1279":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli#command-map","content":"Try one of:\ndecoy demo                       30-second end-to-end walkthrough.\ndecoy storm analyze data.csv     Profile a dataset for PII and risk.\ndecoy profile data.csv           Dataset shape, field stats, PII candidates (suggestions).\ndecoy compile pipeline.yaml --explain  Explain per-column strategy and compile decisions.\ndecoy run pipeline.yaml          Run a masking or generation pipeline.\ndecoy subset pipeline.yaml --dry-run   Preview a FK-aware referential subset.\ndecoy validate config pipeline.yaml  Check a YAML pipeline before running.\ndecoy unmask pipeline.yaml masked.csv   Recover fpe columns from a masked file.\ndecoy fit source.csv             Fit a distribution snapshot for statistical generation.\ndecoy init                       Scaffold a starter pipeline interactively.\ndecoy templates list             Browse bundled pipeline templates.\ndecoy explain modes              Plain-English topic help. `explain` lists topics.\ndecoy info                       Branded splash + quick-start hints.\ndecoy project init               Create a local .decoy/ workspace (local only).\ndecoy catalog list               List the local metadata catalog entri