g/usage\nerror, 3 on a runtime failure."},"2004":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-3","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"**Usage**:"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-4","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"**Arguments**:"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-5","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"`CONFIG`: The pipeline config the mask run used (carries seed + namespaces).  \\[required]"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-6","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"`MASKED`: The masked CSV produced by `decoy run` for one table.  \\[required]"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-7","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"**Options**:"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-8","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"`--table TEXT`: Which config table the masked file belongs to. Required when the config masks more than one table."},"2010":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-9","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"`-o, --output PATH`: Where to write the recovered CSV. Default: \\<masked>.unmasked.csv next to the input."},"2011":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-10","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"`--vault FILE`: Vault file the mask run wrote (decoy run --vault). Recovers one-way columns declared vault: true; decrypts under the config's seed."},"2012":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-11","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unma