tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"decoy unmask pipeline.yaml masked.csv --vault vault.bin\nAlso recover one-way columns the mask run vaulted\n(decoy run ... --vault vault.bin with vault: true columns)."},"2022":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-21","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"Only `strategy: fpe` columns reverse from the config alone; hash,\nredact, faker and the other one-way strategies pass through unchanged\nunless the column was vaulted at mask time. The config carries the\nseed: treat it as a key; the vault file is a re-identification map,\nstore it separately from the masked output."},"2023":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask-22","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/unmask","content":"See also: decoy run, decoy explain strategies."},"2024":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","type":"page","content":"decoy validate","breadcrumbs":["Documentation","Reference","CLI reference"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/cli/validate"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate-0","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","content":"Validate a pipeline config (`config`) or check distribution fidelity between a source and an output (`distribution`)."},"2026":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate-1","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/cli/validate#decoy-validate-config","content":"`decoy validate config`"},"2027":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate-2","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/cli/validate#decoy-validate-distribution","content":"`decoy validate distribution`"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate-3","page_id":"/docs/reference/cli/validate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/cli/